WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.340
Ottawa — Canada's capital, population one million, operating budget four point four billion dollars.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:16.977
The Confederation Line LRT cost two point one billion, opened two and a half years late, and the public inquiry found city officials provided 'incomplete and inadequate oversight.'

00:00:16.977 --> 00:00:22.295
Lansdowne 2.0: a three hundred and thirty-two million dollar sole-source subsidy.

00:00:22.295 --> 00:00:25.795
An infrastructure deficit of two point five billion.

00:00:25.795 --> 00:00:29.193
The city that houses Parliament cannot even run a train on time.
